1
00:00:05,087 --> 00:00:08,367
Why are you here?!

2
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:11,327
The spell to keep me asleep wore off.

3
00:00:11,327 --> 00:00:14,737
That's not what I mean!
I know the spell wore off!

4
00:00:14,737 --> 00:00:19,027
How could you just waltz up to 
me after what I did to you?!

5
00:00:19,027 --> 00:00:21,867
Oh, that's what you meant?

6
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:25,867
I didn't think what you did 
was <i>that</i> horrible, really.

7
00:00:26,277 --> 00:00:30,477
Do you... even have any 
idea what I did to you?

8
00:00:30,477 --> 00:00:33,237
I had every intention of killing you!

9
00:00:34,947 --> 00:00:36,747
That's definitely not true.

10
00:00:37,657 --> 00:00:40,457
I mean, if you really wanted to kill me,

11
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:42,437
it would've been way easier to just

12
00:00:42,437 --> 00:00:45,607
kill me on the spot than use dark 
magic to make me sleep.

13
00:00:46,967 --> 00:00:52,807
I came here because I wanted another 
chance to really talk to you.

14
00:00:52,807 --> 00:00:53,927
Talk?

15
00:00:54,237 --> 00:00:55,747
Yes.

16
00:00:55,747 --> 00:00:57,427
When I looked at you then,

17
00:00:57,427 --> 00:01:00,547
you were crying... and you looked like 
you were in terrible pain.

18
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:05,067
So I wanted to try once more to 
get you to talk to me.

19
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:06,107
Stay away!

20
00:01:07,067 --> 00:01:08,247
Oh, no!

21
00:01:09,077 --> 00:01:10,397
Maria-san!

22
00:01:10,837 --> 00:01:13,237
The black fog is growing bigger!

23
00:01:13,237 --> 00:01:14,417
What?!

24
00:01:14,507 --> 00:01:17,327
Sirius, why would you do this?

25
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:19,577
Where did you get your dark magic?

26
00:01:19,917 --> 00:01:21,907
Answer me, Sirius Dieke!

27
00:01:25,517 --> 00:01:27,027
Sirius?

28
00:01:27,027 --> 00:01:28,837
He doesn't exist anymore.

29
00:01:29,797 --> 00:01:33,387
Sirius died a long time ago!

30
00:01:33,387 --> 00:01:34,547
What are you saying?

31
00:01:34,627 --> 00:01:36,117
Eight years ago,

32
00:01:36,117 --> 00:01:39,997
someone I treasured deeply was 
taken from me here.

33
00:01:39,997 --> 00:01:42,257
They ruined my happiness!

