00:01:49,857 --> 00:01:54,047
The tea you make has such a gentle flavor.

87
00:01:55,617 --> 00:01:58,967
I practiced just so I 
could make you happy, Mom.

88
00:01:59,627 --> 00:02:00,917
Thank you.

89
