I'm blessed to have such a wonderful son.

90
00:02:15,427 --> 00:02:17,657
The child has awakened.

91
00:02:18,027 --> 00:02:19,877
Now we can begin.

92
00:02:22,867 --> 00:02:25,207
My beloved little one...

93
00:02:25,207 --> 00:02:28,077
Soon, you will have a new body.

94
00:02:29,397 --> 00:02:31,757
Now, bring the sacrifice.

95
00:02:36,057 --> 00:02:37,097
Mom!

96
00:02:37,677 --> 00:02:38,947
Stop it!

97
00:02:38,947 --> 00:02:42,197
Do not handle him roughly.

98
00:02:42,197 --> 00:02:45,457
He is going to become my precious Sirius.

99
00:02:45,767 --> 00:02:49,217
Marchioness Dieke, if you despise me,

100
00:02:49,217 --> 00:02:51,397
I don't care what you do to me!

101
00:02:51,527 --> 00:02:54,057
Just spare my son, please!

102
00:02:54,057 --> 00:02:55,957
What impudence!

103
00:02:55,957 --> 00:02:59,367
You took my husband from me and 
were blessed with a child,

104
00:02:59,367 --> 00:03:01,077
and you still demand more?!

105
00:03:01,077 --> 00:03:06,917
I only kept the marquis company that one 
time because he ordered me to on a whim!

106
00:03:06,917 --> 00:03:09,907
I have no intention of 
going anywhere near him again.

107
00:03:09,907 --> 00:03:14,547
I only want to live a quiet life with my child!

108
00:03:17,077 --> 00:03:18,757
I will not...

109
00:03:18,757 --> 00:03:22,367
I will not allow only the two 
of you to live a happy life!

110
00:03:22,367 --> 00:03:24,017
Now, it's time to begin.

111
00:03:24,467 --> 00:03:25,307
Begin what?

112
00:03:25,577 --> 00:03:29,367
My son is afflicted with an incurable disease.

113
00:03:29,367 --> 00:03:33,147
The poor thing doesn't have much time left.

114
00:03:33,147 --> 00:03:37,607
But with dark magic, I can control one's mind

115
00:03:37,607 --> 00:03:39,907
and transfer memories from one to another.

116
00:03:40,247 --> 00:03:44,167
All my son needs is a healthy body, 
and he can live.

117
00:03:44,557 --> 00:03:46,767
Fulfill this need for my son!

118
00:03:46,767 --> 00:03:49,647
If you'll do that, I'll forgive you!

