Wilgwolle.

137
00:04:19,957 --> 00:04:21,437
Mom!

138
00:04:23,107 --> 00:04:26,127
Please... avenge me.

139
00:04:27,617 --> 00:04:29,337
Mom!

140
00:04:29,697 --> 00:04:31,907
Well? Did it work?

141
00:04:31,907 --> 00:04:33,787
Yes, milady.

142
00:04:33,787 --> 00:04:38,137
We have succeeded in acquiring 
dark magic, as the texts stated.

143
00:04:38,477 --> 00:04:40,087
Good. Now...

144
00:04:40,247 --> 00:04:44,107
Transfer Sirius's memories into 
this boy's body.

145
00:04:53,177 --> 00:04:55,217
You are all I have.

146
00:04:55,217 --> 00:04:57,067
I can depend on no one else.

147
00:04:57,067 --> 00:05:00,027
So I won't let you die, my Sirius!

148
00:05:03,607 --> 00:05:04,987
It is done.

149
00:05:10,407 --> 00:05:13,107
Mo...ther...

150
00:05:13,897 --> 00:05:16,227
Sirius! It's you!

151
00:05:16,227 --> 00:05:18,407
The dark magic was successful!

152
00:05:18,707 --> 00:05:22,437
Milady, my work here is done.

153
00:05:22,437 --> 00:05:26,817
May I return to my family 
now, as you promised?

154
00:05:26,817 --> 00:05:30,177
Yes, of course. I'll return you 
to them immediately.

155
00:05:35,437 --> 00:05:38,817
Why... did you deceive me?!

156
00:05:38,817 --> 00:05:41,697
To let you live would be too great a risk.

157
00:05:41,917 --> 00:05:44,327
Curse you!

158
00:05:44,327 --> 00:05:46,747
I won't let you get away with this!

159
00:05:46,747 --> 00:05:49,057
I swear I'll see you rot in hell!

160
00:05:49,057 --> 00:05:49,957
Finish him.

161
00:05:58,967 --> 00:06:02,137
Sirius's memories told me

162
00:06:02,137 --> 00:06:07,507
that my playboy father, the marquis, 
had an affair with my mother, who was a maid.

163
00:06:07,507 --> 00:06:09,547
That woman loathed my mother for it,

164
00:06:09,547 --> 00:06:12,897
so she sacrificed her in 
order to acquire dark magic.

165
00:06:13,157 --> 00:06:15,247
If all had gone according to 
that woman's plan,

166
00:06:15,247 --> 00:06:17,647
I would no longer be myself, 
but only the vessel

167
00:06:17,647 --> 00:06:20,157
that would become Sirius Dieke.

168
00:06:20,297 --> 00:06:22,667
But her plan failed.

169
00:06:22,667 --> 00:06:25,487
That woman just wanted to 
continue clinging to Sirius

170
00:06:25,487 --> 00:06:28,127
so that she could feel better.

171
00:06:28,277 --> 00:06:31,127
The memories transferred to 
me were only information.

172
00:06:31,127 --> 00:06:33,847
They weren't Sirius's actual 
thoughts or feelings.

173
00:06:33,847 --> 00:06:37,877
Also, for some reason, <i>I</i> acquired dark magic.

174
00:06:37,877 --> 00:06:41,087
I figured I could use it to get my revenge.

175
00:06:41,417 --> 00:06:45,567
I've been playing the good boy all 
this time, pretending to be Sirius...

176
00:06:45,567 --> 00:06:49,217
so that I can inherit the Dieke family name

177
00:06:49,217 --> 00:06:51,597
and destroy everything that woman holds dear!

178
00:06:51,857 --> 00:06:53,717
That's what happened?

179
00:06:53,717 --> 00:06:55,737
And that's why you're in such pain...

180
00:06:55,737 --> 00:06:57,357
You hypocrite!

181
00:06:57,527 --> 00:07:01,017
Do you think you can save me 
like you did all those others,

182
00:07:01,017 --> 00:07:03,347
Good Saint Catarina Claes-sama?!

183
00:07:07,137 --> 00:07:09,027
If this goes any further, we're all in danger!

184
00:07:11,277 --> 00:07:12,407
Catarina!

185
00:07:12,407 --> 00:07:13,377
Sister!

186
00:07:13,727 --> 00:07:15,127
I'll be fine.

187
00:07:15,987 --> 00:07:18,477
I know I can't save you.

188
00:07:19,347 --> 00:07:22,157
I'm not the heroine here, after all.

189
00:07:22,157 --> 00:07:25,637
I'm just the villainess, 
here to play the heroine's rival.

190
00:07:25,637 --> 00:07:28,477
Of course I can't save anyone.

191
00:07:28,567 --> 00:07:33,207
I can't save you from your suffering.

192
00:07:33,217 --> 00:07:36,157
but I <i>can</i> stay by your side.

193
00:07:36,697 --> 00:07:38,997
Just like they all did for me,

194
00:07:38,997 --> 00:07:43,647
I can stay by your side, hear you 
out when you're sad or hurt,

195
00:07:43,647 --> 00:07:45,817
and not leave you until you're feeling better.

196
00:07:54,117 --> 00:07:55,847
What's wrong?

197
00:07:58,177 --> 00:08:02,607
Sitting out here crying won't 
make it stop hurting.

198
00:08:02,867 --> 00:08:04,997
I'll stay here with you.

199
00:08:04,997 --> 00:08:07,587
I won't leave you until you're feeling better.

200
00:08:07,927 --> 00:08:11,027
So don't cry all alone,

201
00:08:11,517 --> 00:08:12,837
Raphael.

202
00:08:18,047 --> 00:08:20,887
How do you know my...

203
00:08:23,807 --> 00:08:25,467
Raphael...

204
00:08:26,187 --> 00:08:28,337
Please... live.

205
00:08:28,797 --> 00:08:31,157
Live... and be happy.

206
00:08:32,167 --> 00:08:33,877
I love you.

207
00:08:52,527 --> 00:08:53,857
What are you doing?

208
00:08:53,857 --> 00:08:55,717
Don't listen to what this woman says!

209
00:08:55,947 --> 00:08:58,727
If you take them all hostage, 
you can still get out of this!

210
00:08:58,727 --> 00:08:59,737
No!

211
00:08:59,737 --> 00:09:01,657
I'm done trying to get revenge!

212
00:09:01,657 --> 00:09:02,647
What?!

213
00:09:02,987 --> 00:09:04,567
I remember everything now!

214
00:09:04,567 --> 00:09:06,527
My mom's last words...

215
00:09:06,527 --> 00:09:09,097
She wasn't telling me to avenge her!

216
00:09:09,097 --> 00:09:11,577
Just who are you?!

217
00:09:14,257 --> 00:09:16,087
So you've figured it out.

218
00:09:16,267 --> 00:09:18,807
You're the man who killed my mother!

219
00:09:18,807 --> 00:09:20,497
You found your way inside my mind,

220
00:09:20,497 --> 00:09:22,567
and you've been controlling me all this time!

221
00:09:22,567 --> 00:09:27,007
I was only helping you fulfill your own wish.

222
00:09:27,927 --> 00:09:29,617
It's true that I hate them...

223
00:09:29,617 --> 00:09:31,227
And I hate that woman.

224
00:09:31,227 --> 00:09:35,297
But I didn't survive just so 
I could get revenge!

225
00:09:35,497 --> 00:09:39,177
I survived so I could find happiness!

226
00:09:39,177 --> 00:09:41,757
I won't allow you to be happy!

227
00:09:41,757 --> 00:09:43,137
Traitor!

228
00:09:53,697 --> 00:09:54,967
It's okay.

229
00:10:01,127 --> 00:10:03,367
I'm done living for revenge!

230
00:10:03,637 --> 00:10:05,897
I don't need you!

231
00:10:16,957 --> 00:10:20,327
The black fog is dissipating...

232
00:10:33,737 --> 00:10:35,487
<i>Sirius Dieke...</i>

233
00:10:35,917 --> 00:10:38,267
<i>His real name is Raphael Walt.</i>

234
00:10:38,267 --> 00:10:40,967
<i>He said that he would tell the 
authorities everything</i>

235
00:10:40,967 --> 00:10:42,807
<i>and left the school.</i>

236
00:10:43,287 --> 00:10:45,997
I want to make my mother's wish come true.

237
00:10:46,367 --> 00:10:49,787
I'm going to atone for my sins and start over.

238
00:10:50,477 --> 00:10:51,977
President...

239
00:10:52,827 --> 00:10:59,427
<i>His testimony exposed the crimes of 
Marchioness Dieke and her underlings.</i>

240
00:10:59,847 --> 00:11:03,177
<i>I miss having the student council 
president around,</i>

241
00:11:03,177 --> 00:11:08,417
<i>but I've avoided the bad ending in 
which everyone gets killed.</i>

242
00:11:09,057 --> 00:11:11,937
<i>Still... I can't let my guard down just yet!</i>

243
00:11:12,567 --> 00:11:14,457
<i>The game's final event,</i>

244
00:11:14,457 --> 00:11:16,547
<i>the second-years' graduation party,</i>

245
00:11:16,547 --> 00:11:18,147
<i>is still to come!</i>

246
00:11:19,417 --> 00:11:21,287
There, it's all done.

247
00:11:21,547 --> 00:11:24,467
I let out the midsection a bit,

248
00:11:24,467 --> 00:11:26,887
but you should be careful not to overeat.

249
00:11:27,677 --> 00:11:30,717
I know! Thanks, Anne!

250
00:11:31,097 --> 00:11:33,797
<i>The time has finally come.</i>

251
00:11:34,057 --> 00:11:36,427
<i>Whether I meet my doom or not</i>

252
00:11:36,687 --> 00:11:39,177
<i>depends on today's graduation party!</i>

253
00:11:40,247 --> 00:11:45,397
Our 19,800th strategy meeting 
will now commence.

254
00:11:45,547 --> 00:11:48,947
The day of the second-years' 
graduation party is finally here!

255
00:11:49,227 --> 00:11:53,607
The game's heroine, Maria, leaves 
in the middle of the party

256
00:11:53,767 --> 00:11:57,117
to confess her love to 
the object of her affections!

