Whether Maria has a 
happy ending or a bad ending

392
00:12:04,937 --> 00:12:07,767
will determine the course of 
Catarina's future!

393
00:12:07,767 --> 00:12:10,997
To be exiled, or to be killed by 
the conquerable characters...

394
00:12:10,997 --> 00:12:13,847
We've made all the preparations we 
could to avoid both.

395
00:12:13,967 --> 00:12:14,887
Yes.

396
00:12:14,887 --> 00:12:19,017
She's been preparing for 
this ever since she was little.

397
00:12:19,127 --> 00:12:21,377
Let's go over things one last time!

398
00:12:21,487 --> 00:12:22,547
Right!

399
00:12:22,547 --> 00:12:26,277
The toy snake she carries to 
scare Geordo is in her pocket!

400
00:12:26,407 --> 00:12:30,527
All the things she'll need to 
survive in exile are packed.

401
00:12:30,627 --> 00:12:32,517
So everything is ready.

402
00:12:32,517 --> 00:12:34,567
All we can do now is hope for the best!

403
00:12:34,717 --> 00:12:39,907
This meeting is now adjourned!

404
00:12:40,137 --> 00:12:42,487
It's the culmination of the past eight years.

405
00:12:42,487 --> 00:12:44,897
Bring it on if you must, doom flag!

406
00:12:44,897 --> 00:12:47,847
I, Catarina, will take you on!

407
00:12:49,457 --> 00:12:52,487
Take care, Catarina-sama.

408
00:12:56,637 --> 00:12:59,877
Congratulations on your graduation, 
Nicol-sama!

409
00:13:00,527 --> 00:13:01,857
Thank you.

410
00:13:04,637 --> 00:13:06,097
Brother.

411
00:13:06,407 --> 00:13:08,687
Congratulations on your graduation.

412
00:13:08,687 --> 00:13:11,917
Nicol-sama, this is for you.

413
00:13:11,917 --> 00:13:13,647
Oh, thank you.

414
00:13:13,797 --> 00:13:16,317
I have a present for you, too!

415
00:13:16,317 --> 00:13:18,507
Here you go. I hope you like it.

416
00:13:22,997 --> 00:13:25,187
Catarina-sama, what is that?

417
00:13:25,187 --> 00:13:26,627
What's going on?

418
00:13:27,007 --> 00:13:28,847
What's up with this grass?

419
00:13:28,847 --> 00:13:32,447
How rude! That's not just grass!

420
00:13:32,827 --> 00:13:34,757
I call it a veggie bouquet!

421
00:13:35,857 --> 00:13:37,647
A veggie... bouquet?

422
00:13:38,327 --> 00:13:41,217
I figured it would be boring to 
get nothing but flowers,

423
00:13:41,217 --> 00:13:44,007
so I made a bouquet out 
of vegetables from my farm!

424
00:13:44,457 --> 00:13:46,707
Instead of just a decoration to 
throw away later,

425
00:13:46,707 --> 00:13:49,317
I thought you'd like something that 
would fill your belly!

426
00:13:57,007 --> 00:13:59,857
Thank you. I'll eat it with gratitude.

427
00:14:28,237 --> 00:14:30,847
<i>Maria hasn't made her move yet.</i>

428
00:14:30,847 --> 00:14:33,807
<i>The two of them have already started 
performing together...</i>

429
00:14:34,337 --> 00:14:38,837
<i>No sign of Keith or Nicol leaving 
with Maria, either.</i>

430
00:14:38,837 --> 00:14:41,777
<i>I don't think the game even had a scene</i>

431
00:14:41,777 --> 00:14:43,817
<i>where Geordo and Alan performed together...</i>

432
00:14:43,977 --> 00:14:45,527
<i>What's going on?</i>

433
00:14:46,567 --> 00:14:50,147
<i>Did this somehow turn into the 
reverse harem route,</i>

434
00:14:50,147 --> 00:14:53,047
<i>where Maria ends up with all of them?!</i>

435
00:14:53,047 --> 00:14:55,127
<i>I never cleared the reverse harem route,</i>

436
00:14:55,127 --> 00:14:58,377
<i>but Acchan told me that Catarina is 
doomed at the end of it, too!</i>

437
00:14:59,447 --> 00:15:00,857
<i>What are you going to do, Maria?!</i>

438
00:15:00,857 --> 00:15:02,247
<i>Are you going for a reverse harem,</i>

439
00:15:02,247 --> 00:15:05,337
<i>or are you going to end up with one of them?!</i>

440
00:15:21,977 --> 00:15:24,167
<i>The party will be over soon!</i>

441
00:15:24,167 --> 00:15:26,067
<i>Why aren't you doing anything, Maria?!</i>

442
00:15:27,157 --> 00:15:29,537
Sister, I think you're eating too much.

443
00:15:29,537 --> 00:15:30,917
Huh? Am I?

444
00:15:32,917 --> 00:15:35,147
I've been a little worried about something.

445
00:15:35,147 --> 00:15:37,967
I didn't even realize I was eating so much.

446
00:15:37,967 --> 00:15:41,087
I think your stomach is what you 
should be worried about.

447
00:15:41,087 --> 00:15:45,087
Catarina-sama, please have my 
cake, as well, if you'd like.

448
00:15:45,087 --> 00:15:46,087
And mine!

449
00:15:47,687 --> 00:15:48,927
Thanks.

450
00:15:48,927 --> 00:15:51,347
I'm just going to go get a drink.

451
00:15:51,817 --> 00:15:55,647
<i>My fate depends on the direction 
Maria's love life takes!</i>

452
00:15:55,647 --> 00:15:57,357
<i>I can't wait around any longer!</i>

453
00:15:58,537 --> 00:15:59,887
Hey, Maria!

454
00:16:05,557 --> 00:16:07,527
Is there someone you like?

455
00:16:12,227 --> 00:16:16,117
I'm very fond of you, Catarina-sama.

456
00:16:17,287 --> 00:16:19,227
Um, Maria...

457
00:16:19,227 --> 00:16:21,317
I'm happy to hear that...

458
00:16:21,317 --> 00:16:22,627
but that's not what I mean.

459
00:16:22,627 --> 00:16:26,137
Is there a boy that you like and 
want to have a relationship with?

460
00:16:26,457 --> 00:16:31,107
A boy I like and want a relationship with...

461
00:16:31,107 --> 00:16:33,797
<i>Come on, tell me straight-up!</i>

462
00:16:33,797 --> 00:16:36,067
<i>Maria, who are you going to end up with?!</i>

463
00:16:38,007 --> 00:16:39,297
No, there isn't.

464
00:16:39,297 --> 00:16:40,107
Huh?

465
00:16:40,107 --> 00:16:42,967
There aren't any boys I'm interested in.

466
00:16:42,967 --> 00:16:48,837
The only one I love, admire, 
and want to be with for all time

467
00:16:48,837 --> 00:16:50,607
is you, Catarina-sama.

468
00:16:50,977 --> 00:16:55,917
So please allow me to stay by 
your side from now on.

469
00:16:55,917 --> 00:17:00,667
<i>Th-That's the line she says to the 
guy she conquers in the game!</i>

470
00:17:00,667 --> 00:17:02,257
<i>Why is she saying it to me?!</i>

471
00:17:02,257 --> 00:17:04,717
I won't allow you to get 
ahead of me, Maria-san.

472
00:17:04,717 --> 00:17:07,687
I'm staying with Catarina-sama forever, too!

473
00:17:07,687 --> 00:17:08,967
Me, too!

474
00:17:09,097 --> 00:17:12,587
Catarina-sama, please allow me 
to be with you forever and ever!

475
00:17:12,747 --> 00:17:15,727
Then I'd like to be with you, too, 
for as long as I may.

476
00:17:15,727 --> 00:17:17,467
Th-Then so would I!

477
00:17:17,467 --> 00:17:19,737
What are you all talking about?

478
00:17:19,737 --> 00:17:22,197
Catarina is engaged to me.

479
00:17:22,197 --> 00:17:24,997
Geordo-sama, as I've told you many times,

480
00:17:24,997 --> 00:17:27,487
my sister isn't fit to 
serve as a prince's consort.

481
00:17:27,647 --> 00:17:30,847
Keith, as I've told you many, many times,

482
00:17:30,847 --> 00:17:33,297
I will absolutely never break 
off our engagement.

483
00:17:33,297 --> 00:17:36,007
Perhaps it's time for you 
to outgrow your big sister.

484
00:17:36,987 --> 00:17:38,827
<i>Could this be...</i>

485
00:17:39,077 --> 00:17:41,287
<i>It is! It's the friendship ending!</i>

486
00:17:41,777 --> 00:17:43,867
<i>The heroine doesn't end up with anyone,</i>

487
00:17:43,867 --> 00:17:46,017
<i>but the story ends with everyone 
being good friends.</i>

488
00:17:46,017 --> 00:17:49,477
<i>It might be considered a bad 
ending by romance game standards,</i>

489
00:17:49,477 --> 00:17:52,267
<i>but this means I'm not doomed!</i>

490
00:17:52,527 --> 00:17:59,597
<i>I did it! I avoided my doom ending!</i>

491
00:18:04,137 --> 00:18:06,697
Thank you all so much for coming today.

492
00:18:06,807 --> 00:18:10,437
Brother, please come visit us 
at school whenever you like.

493
00:18:10,847 --> 00:18:13,677
You'll fall behind the others if you don't.

494
00:18:15,077 --> 00:18:17,647
Everyone, we have dessert, too.

495
00:18:17,647 --> 00:18:19,507
Please help yourselves.

496
00:18:19,917 --> 00:18:22,157
Wow! It looks even tastier than usual today!

497
00:18:22,157 --> 00:18:23,247
Did you make it?

498
00:18:23,247 --> 00:18:27,047
Yes, my mother and I 
came up with a new recipe.

499
00:18:27,047 --> 00:18:28,247
Your mother?

500
00:18:28,457 --> 00:18:34,337
She thought you might get tired of 
eating the same sweets all the time,

501
00:18:34,337 --> 00:18:37,397
so she helped me come up with a new recipe.

502
00:18:37,617 --> 00:18:39,347
I see!

503
00:18:39,347 --> 00:18:42,047
Be sure to thank her for me, too.

504
00:18:42,047 --> 00:18:42,987
I will.

505
00:18:42,987 --> 00:18:45,787
We have tea, as well, Catarina-sama.

506
00:18:45,787 --> 00:18:47,407
Thanks, Mary!

507
00:18:48,187 --> 00:18:50,027
Let's eat!

508
00:18:52,897 --> 00:18:54,167
This is...

509
00:18:58,927 --> 00:19:00,077
President!

510
00:19:00,277 --> 00:19:02,857
I'm not the student council president anymore,

511
00:19:02,857 --> 00:19:05,877
but thank you for inviting me.

512
00:19:06,027 --> 00:19:09,767
We invited him because we knew it'd 
make you happy, Catarina-sama.

513
00:19:09,767 --> 00:19:12,787
And we kept quiet so it would be a surprise.

514
00:19:12,787 --> 00:19:14,707
I had no idea!

515
00:19:14,707 --> 00:19:16,927
I'm so happy to see you, President!

516
00:19:16,927 --> 00:19:19,727
Uh, I mean... Raphael-sama!

517
00:19:20,057 --> 00:19:22,387
Are you coming back to school?

